sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant API as Scheduler API
    participant Store as Job Store
    participant Wheel as Time Wheel / Tick
    participant Worker

    Client->>API: Submit Job (cron / one-shot)
    API->>Store: Save Job Definition
    API-->>Client: Return Job ID

    loop Every Tick
        Wheel->>Store: Find due jobs
        Store-->>Wheel: List of due jobs
        Wheel->>Store: Create ExecutionRun & enqueue
    end

    Worker->>Store: Claim pending Run (Lock)
    Store-->>Worker: Run details

    loop During execution
        Worker->>Store: Send Heartbeat
    end

    alt Job completes successfully
        Worker->>Store: Ack Completion
    else Job fails / Worker crashes
        Worker--xStore: Heartbeat missed or Nack
        Wheel->>Store: Detect missed heartbeat
        Wheel->>Store: Retry backoff / Re-enqueue
    end
